  "id": "pdat",
  "term": "PDAT",
  "definition": "PDAT stands for Predictors of Dropout from Addiction Treatment, a scale created to assess factors linked to leaving addiction treatment early. It focuses on four areas: motivation to recover and engage in treatment, craving, awareness of the addiction problem, and dysphoria such as inner restlessness or low mood that may come before withdrawal from treatment.",
